# The build context is the task root, so keep everything that is not shipped
# out of it: caches, the agent-facing prompt, the reference solution, the
# offline grader auditor -- that one calls a model, and nothing in the graded
# image is allowed to -- and the host-side halves of the task.
#
# `agent` and the ops scripts run on the machine that starts the run, never
# inside it. The agent's model call in particular happens on the host, which is
# what lets a container with no network be driven by a model on localhost; a
# copy of the client in the image would only be a second place for a credential
# to end up.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.git
jobs
instruction.md
solution
README.md
RUN_REPORT.md
tools
agent
task_2_instructions.md
run.sh
kill.sh
view.sh
analyze.sh
audit.sh
